   "url": "https://www.energy.senate.gov/wp-content/uploads/media/doc/Updated_Rosner%20Testimony%207-22-26%20SENR%20Hrg.pdf",
   "text": "Over the last year the Commission has acted to ensure that demand growth leads to a more reliable, affordable, and sustainable grid—and that America can win the AI race without regular families paying for it.",
